# Per-step monitoring snapshots. The watcher archives one figure per rollout, so
# a 250-step run leaves ~250 PNGs (~55 MB). They are a live-watching convenience,
# not a deliverable: the committed artifacts stay metrics.jsonl, the current
# reward.png and summary.json. The files remain on disk for inspection.
reports/*/steps/
